her father told her as a child.\n<br><br>\nIt follows a 13 year old girl named Aki. During a pilgrimage to Sensou-ji (a Buddhist temple located in Asakusa, Tokyo), she found a mistake in the sangaku. News spread quickly of her intellect and eventually landed upon Arima Yoriyuki, the lord of the Kurume Domain (he himself was famous for finding the rational approximation of pi). He hired Aki to become an arithmetic teacher for the region's princess, but hired others as well. In a math competition, Aki fought against other geniuses and prodigies, all for the hopes of earning a wage so that she may one day open a school for poor children so that she can teach them arithmetic as well.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2016, "episodes": 1, "duration": 97, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 183800, "title": {"romaji": "Arinko Hepo: Futari no Himitsu Kichi", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Studio Nanahoshi's first independently produced anime!<br>\nHepo the ant and Popo the ladybug run around their \"secret hideout\" made of leaves and branches!<br><br>\n(Source: YouTube Description, Translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 3}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2016, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Animal Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Outdoor Activities", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kids", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Anthropomorphism", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 185614, "title": {"romaji": "Vita Lakamaya", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "In the woods, every creature is sleeping. Listen carefully to their quiet breathing. It’s the sounds of this innocent world that called \"Vita Lakamaya\"....\n<br><br>\n(Source: Studio Mangosteen)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 187215, "title": {"romaji": "Good Morning!!! Doronjo", "english": null}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "The 3rd in a series of Flash animation shows following “<i>Good Morning Genie Family</i>”. Doronjo, Boyacky, and Tonzra, the iconic villains from “<i>Yatterman</i>”, engage in an endless chain of unproductive conversations. With even the characters from “<i>Good Morning Gatchaman</i>” making appearances, the parties face off in an interesting battle!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official Site)", "startDate": {"year": 2015, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 3}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2015, "episodes": 243, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 188051, "title": {"romaji": "Spookiz 2", "english": "Spookiz Season 2"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of <i>Spookiz</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 8}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 23, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 188057, "title": {"romaji": "Kkoma Bus Tayo-ui Ace Guchuljakjeon", "english": "The Tayo Movie: Mission Ace"}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "It all starts when Duri lost his favorite sport car “Ace”. As Duri accidentally drops Ace on the road while he’s running, Rubby found Ace on the road while he was cleaning the street. Rubby thought it was garbage, so threw Ace away on the garbage dumb. So as Hana, Duri and Tayo rushed and went to find Ace, he was already taken away to the Land of Toys! Toy Land is where old and abandoned toys come to live together without humans! (Only lucky toys though!) Will Duri be able to find Ace and bring him back? It will be a fun but a long adventure, so come with us!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official YouTube channel)", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 47, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure"], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 188058, "title": {"romaji": "Kkoma Bus Tayo 4", "english": "Tayo the Little Bus Season 4"}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "The fourth season of <i>Kkoma Bus Tayo</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2016, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 26, "duration": 11, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure"], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}]}}}